**Implementation** (`robot_name.py`):
- `Robot.__init__` generates a random name of format 2 uppercase letters + 3 digits (e.g., `RX837`).
- A class-level `_used_names` set enforces global uniqueness across all robots; collisions retry.
- `reset()` frees the old name and generates a new one, keeping existing robots unique.

